{
  "lang": "en",
  "film": "The Newsroom",
  "source_rel": "Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 1_有史以来最伟大的表演独白 PART 1/Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 1_有史以来最伟大的表演独白 PART 1.mp4",
  "t_start_global": 571.45,
  "t_end_global": 749.38,
  "duration": 177.93,
  "clip": "The Newsroom.mp4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.48,
      "text": "Not the greatest country in the world, professor.",
      "filename": "segment001.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 1.58,
      "end": 2.4,
      "text": "That's my answer.",
      "filename": "segment002.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 6.32,
      "end": 7.18,
      "text": "You're saying-",
      "filename": "segment003.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 7.18,
      "end": 7.4,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "filename": "segment004.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 9.34,
      "end": 10.44,
      "text": "Let's talk about-",
      "filename": "segment005.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 10.72,
      "end": 12.52,
      "text": "Sharon, the NEA is a loser.",
      "filename": "segment006.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 12.76,
      "end": 14.58,
      "text": "Yeah, it accounts for a penny out of our paycheck.",
      "filename": "segment007.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 14.72,
      "end": 16.52,
      "text": "But he gets to hit you with it anytime he wants.",
      "filename": "segment008.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 16.56,
      "end": 17.34,
      "text": "It doesn't cost money.",
      "filename": "segment009.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 17.42,
      "end": 18.02,
      "text": "It costs votes.",
      "filename": "segment010.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 18.12,
      "end": 19.86,
      "text": "It costs airtime and column inches.",
      "filename": "segment011.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 20.16,
      "end": 21.48,
      "text": "You know why people don't like liberals?",
      "filename": "segment012.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 21.8,
      "end": 22.4,
      "text": "Because they lose.",
      "filename": "segment013.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 23.02,
      "end": 26.2,
      "text": "If liberals are so fucking smart, how come they lose so goddamn always?",
      "filename": "segment014.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 26.3,
      "end": 26.66,
      "text": "Hey-",
      "filename": "segment015.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 26.66,
      "end": 31.0,
      "text": "And with a straight face, you're gonna tell students that America is so star-spangled",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 33.4,
      "text": "awesome that we're the only ones in the world who have freedom?",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 34.02,
      "end": 35.04,
      "text": "Canada has freedom.",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 35.14,
      "end": 36.34,
      "text": "Japan has freedom.",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 36.34,
      "end": 41.78,
      "text": "The UK, France, Italy, Germany, Spain, Australia, Belgium has freedom.",
      "filename": "segment020.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 42.1,
      "end": 45.78,
      "text": "So 207 sovereign states in the world, like 180 of them have freedom.",
      "filename": "segment021.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 45.86,
      "end": 46.08,
      "text": "All right.",
      "filename": "segment022.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 46.16,
      "end": 47.78,
      "text": "And yeah, you, sorority girl.",
      "filename": "segment023.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 47.94,
      "end": 51.22,
      "text": "Just in case you accidentally wander into a voting booth one day, there's some things",
      "filename": "segment024.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 51.22,
      "end": 51.64,
      "text": "you should know.",
      "filename": "segment025.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 51.68,
      "end": 55.42,
      "text": "And one of them is there is absolutely no evidence to support the statement that we're",
      "filename": "segment026.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 55.42,
      "end": 56.7,
      "text": "the greatest country in the world.",
      "filename": "segment027.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 56.88,
      "end": 62.28,
      "text": "We're seventh in literacy, 27th in math, 22nd in science, 49th in life expectancy,",
      "filename": "segment028.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 63.08,
      "end": 67.34,
      "text": "178th in infant mortality, third in median household income, number four in labor force,",
      "filename": "segment029.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 67.4,
      "end": 68.48,
      "text": "and number four in exports.",
      "filename": "segment030.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 68.6,
      "end": 73.18,
      "text": "We lead the world in only three categories, number of incarcerated citizens per capita,",
      "filename": "segment031.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 73.46,
      "end": 77.28,
      "text": "number of adults who believe angels are real, and defense spending, where we spend more",
      "filename": "segment032.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 77.28,
      "end": 80.56,
      "text": "than the next 26 countries combined, 25 of whom are allies.",
      "filename": "segment033.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 80.66,
      "end": 84.28,
      "text": "Now, none of this is the fault of a 20-year-old college student, but you nonetheless are,",
      "filename": "segment034.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 84.42,
      "end": 88.58,
      "text": "without a doubt, a member of the worst period generation period ever, period.",
      "filename": "segment035.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 88.66,
      "end": 92.26,
      "text": "So when you ask what makes us the greatest country in the world, I don't know what the",
      "filename": "segment036.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 92.26,
      "end": 93.52,
      "text": "fuck you're talking about.",
      "filename": "segment037.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 94.38,
      "end": 94.9,
      "text": "Yosemite?",
      "filename": "segment038.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 107.78,
      "end": 108.9,
      "text": "Sure used to be.",
      "filename": "segment039.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 110.44,
      "end": 112.0,
      "text": "We stood up for what was right.",
      "filename": "segment040.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 113.54,
      "end": 115.18,
      "text": "We fought for moral reasons.",
      "filename": "segment041.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 115.32,
      "end": 118.46,
      "text": "We passed laws, struck down laws for moral reasons.",
      "filename": "segment042.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 118.6,
      "end": 120.66,
      "text": "We waged wars on poverty, not poor people.",
      "filename": "segment043.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 121.94,
      "end": 122.94,
      "text": "We sacrificed.",
      "filename": "segment044.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 123.22,
      "end": 124.58,
      "text": "We cared about our neighbors.",
      "filename": "segment045.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 124.78,
      "end": 127.62,
      "text": "We put our money where our mouths were, and we never beat our chest.",
      "filename": "segment046.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 127.8,
      "end": 133.74,
      "text": "We built great big things, made ungodly technological advances, explored the universe,",
      "filename": "segment047.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 133.74,
      "end": 138.82,
      "text": "cured disease, and we cultivated the world's greatest artists and the world's greatest",
      "filename": "segment048.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 138.82,
      "end": 139.36,
      "text": "economy.",
      "filename": "segment049.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 142.07,
      "end": 147.32,
      "text": "We reached for the stars, acted like men.",
      "filename": "segment050.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 147.58,
      "end": 149.04,
      "text": "We aspired to intelligence.",
      "filename": "segment051.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 149.18,
      "end": 149.92,
      "text": "We didn't belittle it.",
      "filename": "segment052.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 149.96,
      "end": 151.32,
      "text": "It didn't make us feel inferior.",
      "filename": "segment053.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 154.02,
      "end": 157.36,
      "text": "We didn't identify ourselves by who we voted for in the last election, and we didn't",
      "filename": "segment054.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 158.02,
      "end": 158.98,
      "text": "scare so easy.",
      "filename": "segment055.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 164.06,
      "end": 167.58,
      "text": "We were able to be all these things and do all these things because we were informed",
      "filename": "segment056.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 169.92,
      "end": 172.28,
      "text": "by great men, men who were revered.",
      "filename": "segment057.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 174.61,
      "end": 177.93,
      "text": "First step in solving any problem is recognizing there is one.",
      "filename": "segment058.mp4"
    }
  ]
}